## Recommended Order of Execution

```
Week 1 (Pre-Launch)
├── Items 2, 3, 4 (quick critical fixes)
├── Item 1 (test coverage for check-in flow)
├── Items 6, 7, 8, 9 (infra hardening)
└── Item 5 (GPS cleanup verification)

Week 2 (Post-Launch Stabilization)
├── Items 10, 11 (observability)
├── Item 13 (admin concurrency)
└── Item 15 (mobile API config)

Week 3-4 (Operational Maturity)
├── Item 12 (infrastructure-as-code)
└── Item 14 (E2E test suite)
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The architecture and schema are **production-caliber**. The gaps are in **operational readiness** — testing, infra config, monitoring, and deployment safety. Fix the Tier 1 items and you're safe to launch.
